[[0,1340740,0,3,0,3,"2016-10-12T01:04:07","HurtLoyd","",[],"<p>I mean hunting and being hunted by other people not going raw in someone.</p>","Would you play the most dangerous game?","","AskVoat"],[1,6541897,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-12T01:08:13","Spaceballs-1","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/kE_zqVPr4HI\">Nope</a></p>"],[1,6541922,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-12T01:11:42","iusedtobeonreddit","",[],"<p>hurling? </p>"],[1,6542002,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-12T01:21:29","watch_listed","",[],"<p>I've had a price on my head, before. I didn't personally enjoy it. As for hunting people, well, the movies get some things right and they get some things wrong.</p>"],[2,6544582,6542002,0,0,0,"2016-10-12T11:34:17","Voopin__Voopin","",[],"<p>what do they get right or wrong?</p>\n<p>glad you no longer have the bounty on ya.</p>"],[3,6548877,6544582,1,0,1,"2016-10-12T21:49:07","watch_listed","[e]",[],"<p>Rifle fire really does make that 'zip' sound as it flies by. When people are shot, you may not see pools of blood,it might just be a small hole. Not everybody screams when they're seriously injured, some people remain stone faced and calm as fuck. Explosions don't look like in the movies.</p>"],[4,6548917,6548877,0,0,0,"2016-10-12T21:53:39","Voopin__Voopin","",[],"<p>Thanks!</p>"],[1,6542032,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-12T01:24:55","chryseos-geckota","",[],"<p>Maybe the hunting people as a job for a legitimate purpose or if justifiably hunting someone(revenge, etc.), but not just for the sport of it no.</p>\n<p>Don't think I'd like to be hunted either...funny, I just finished reading Running Man. It didn't sound like an appealing proposition.</p>"],[1,6542250,0,2,0,2,"2016-10-12T02:00:50","lbruiser","",[],"<p>I already play dark souls...</p>"],[1,6542324,0,2,1,1,"2016-10-12T02:13:06","Big_Amish","",[],"<p>Porque no los dos?</p>"],[2,6542564,6542324,2,1,1,"2016-10-12T02:51:30","metawizard","",[],"<p>por que*</p>"],[1,6542652,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-12T03:07:41","lord_nougat","",[],"<p>Full contact nude battle chess?</p>"],[1,6542747,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-12T03:21:47","Lord-Stokeworth","",[],"<p>Smelling Hillary Clinton's vag?</p>"]]
